[00:59:06] [Async Chat Thread - #264/INFO]: [Not Secure] <Cody> Morning. I'm standing in the hollow with one cobble and a furnace still hungry — home's just west along the south shoulder, and I'll walk it the safe way, south of that pit, never across it.
